{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And provisions</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here, and the other: ומזון לכלא ביה. Even though it says ומזון לאביו ומזון לכלא ביה — provisions for his father and provisions for all therein — that he sent provisions to sustain all of them."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:25.200805873Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}